    Asset Store)\r\nMini-Legion Rock Golem (PolyArt) \u2013 Dungeon Mason (Unity
    Asset Store)\r\n3 Free Characters \u2013 HONETi (Unity Asset Store)\r\n\r\nEnvironment
    Asset\r\n\r\nLowpoly Environment \u2013 Nature Free (Medieval Fantasy Series)
    \u2013 PSPolytope Studio (Unity Asset Store)\r\n\r\nAnimal Asset\r\n\r\nAnimals
    Free (Animated Low-Poly 3D Models) \u2013 ithappy (Unity Asset Store)\r\n\r\nSkill
    VFX Asset\r\n\r\nMagic Effects Free \u2013 Hovl Studio (Unity Asset Store)\r\n\r\nAudio
    Assets\r\n\r\nFree 10 Medieval Ambient & Fantasy Tracks (Music Pack) \u2013 alkakrab
    (Unity Asset Store)\r\nFantasy Battle Music (Free Pack) \u2013 Tyler Cunningham
    (Unity Asset Store)\r\n"
